LASSIFIER_MODEL };\",\n              \"note\": \"Every returned decision spreads base, so classifierId and requestedModel are always present; servedModel is set on each branch.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"subject\": \"timeout/error branch\",\n              \"status\": \"enforced\",\n              \"evidence\": \"src/agent/classifier.ts:57\",\n              \"quote\": \"return { ...base, servedModel: null, intent: null, confidence: null, route: \\\"staff\\\", failure: timeout ? \\\"timeout\\\" : \\\"api_error\\\" };\",\n              \"note\": \"Failure decision keeps the classifier identity and is audited.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"subject\": \"model mismatch branch\",\n              \"status\": \"enforced\",\n              \"evidence\": \"src/agent/classifier.ts:61\",\n              \"quote\": \"return { ...base, servedModel: res.model, intent: null, confidence: null, route: \\\"staff\\\", failure: \\\"model_mismatch\\\" };\",\n              \"note\": \"Records both requested and served model.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"subject\": \"success branch\",\n              \"status\": \"enforced\",\n              \"evidence\": \"src/agent/classifier.ts:76\",\n              \"quote\": \"return { ...base, servedModel: res.model, ...parsed, route, failure: null };\",\n              \"note\": \"Success decision carries identity and served model.\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"deviations\": [],\n          \"attempts\": [\n            {\n              \"category\": \"failure-branch logging\",\n              \"input\": \"Anthropic call times out (APIConnectionTimeoutError) after 4000 ms\",\n              \"trace\": \"catch at classifier.ts:55 sets timeout true, returns a staff decision containing base identity; classifyIntent returns normally, so loop.ts:42 still writes intent.classified with the failure.\",\n              \"outcome\": \"blocked\",\n              \"evidence\": \"src/agent/classifier